WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.628
♪ Music playing ♪

00:00:02.628 --> 00:00:04.755
[KNOCKING]
This feels wrong.

00:00:04.755 --> 00:00:06.423
We're disturbing
his sacred solitude.

00:00:06.423 --> 00:00:07.758
We shouldn't have come.

00:00:07.758 --> 00:00:09.885
♪

00:00:09.885 --> 00:00:12.429
This scene
is Henry David Thoreau,

00:00:12.429 --> 00:00:14.097
naturalist and writer,

00:00:14.097 --> 00:00:17.100
being a real jerk to two guests,
George and Emily.

00:00:17.100 --> 00:00:19.269
You're going to entertain
your guests half naked?

00:00:19.269 --> 00:00:23.482
These are not my guests because
I didn't even invite them.

00:00:23.482 --> 00:00:25.609
He's a little bit of a letdown.
[LAUGHS]

00:00:25.609 --> 00:00:27.027
But in a funny way.

00:00:27.027 --> 00:00:30.405
I'd rather sit on a pumpkin
and have it all to myself

00:00:30.405 --> 00:00:33.408
than be crowded
on a velvet cushion.

00:00:33.408 --> 00:00:34.243
Write that down.

00:00:34.243 --> 00:00:35.410
He's a naturalist.

00:00:35.410 --> 00:00:37.329
She assumes he'll be a good man.
He's not.

00:00:37.329 --> 00:00:38.789
Why do I care about your tree?

00:00:38.789 --> 00:00:41.583
You said you loved the woods.
- I love my woods.

00:00:41.583 --> 00:00:43.669
Everyone really makes it big
during their lifetime --

00:00:43.669 --> 00:00:45.003
they become insufferable.

00:00:45.003 --> 00:00:47.923
Emily Dickinson didn't get
to become big in her lifetime.

00:00:47.923 --> 00:00:50.425
Henry David Thoreau did,
and he was insufferable.

00:00:50.425 --> 00:00:52.761
You're a dick!
- Never meet your heroes.

00:00:52.761 --> 00:00:54.596
♪

00:00:54.596 --> 00:00:55.597
[SLAM]

00:00:57.266 --> 00:00:59.977
♪

